<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">UTM Templates</h1>
<p>Save your frequently used UTM parameter combinations as templates for quick, consistent link creation.</p>

<h2>Creating a Template</h2>
<ol><li>Go to <strong>Library → UTM Templates</strong></li><li>Click <strong>+ New Template</strong></li><li>Give it a name (e.g., "Facebook CPC")</li><li>Fill in the UTM parameters you want to reuse</li><li>Click <strong>Save</strong></li></ol>

<h2>Using a Template</h2>
<p>When creating a new link, select a template from the dropdown. All UTM fields will auto-fill.</p>

<h2>Example Templates</h2>
